d make "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"a configured `keyword` or `neural` fail argument validation and take the whole anonymous path down. "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"The tool's default is what `auto` asks for anyway."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Pinning `mcpTool: web_search_exa` restores the older text-blob path, where the same results arrive a"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"s `Title:`-led sections. Use it if Exa changes the structured tool's shape; a body that is not the e"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"xpected JSON already falls back to section parsing on its own."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Version compatibility"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Every published dsh version from `0.1.2-alpha.2` to `0.2.1-alpha.1` has been tested. Testing means t"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"hree things: installing that version in isolation, typechecking against its own declarations, and in"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"stalling this plugin with npm under strict peer resolution. The last step is the one that fails most"},{"id":"p23s4","text":" easily, because npm's peer rules are stricter than pnpm's. To reproduce: `bash scripts/compat-matri"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"y, because npm's peer rules are stricter than pnpm's. To reproduce: `bash scripts/compat-matrix.sh`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| dsh line | Tested | Notes |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `0.1.2-alpha.2` … `0.1.2-alpha.5` | ✅ | the oldest supported baseline |\n| `0.1.2-rc.1` | ✅ | |\n| `"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"0.1.3-alpha.2` | ✅ | |\n| `0.1.5-alpha.1`, `0.1.5-alpha.2` | ✅ | |\n| `0.1.5-rc.1`, `0.1.5-rc.2`, `0.1"},{"id":"p25s3","text":".5-rc.3` | ✅ | `0.1.5-rc.2` is also verified end to end: a real `dsh --profile headless` task search"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ed through the anonymous MCP path with no API key |\n| `0.1.6-alpha.1`, `0.1.6-alpha.2` | ✅ | |\n| `0."},{"id":"p25s5","text":"1.7-alpha.1` | ✅ | the settings service changed shape, see below |\n| `0.2.0-rc.1`, `0.2.0-rc.2` | ✅ "},{"id":"p25s6","text":"| strict npm install beside the host, then a live keyless search |\n| `0.2.1-alpha.1` | ✅ | same, and"},{"id":"p25s7","text":" the only version that needs `@deepseek-ai/cordis@4.0.5-alpha.1` |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Versions from the `0.2.0-rc.1` line onward are additionally declared, one full version at a time, un"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"der `dsh.compatibility.dshReleases` in `package.json`. That key is catalog metadata: the dsh runtime"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" never reads it, and it does not affect resolution — registries such as DSH STORE require an exact p"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"er-version record, and a peer range is not installable evidence. The declarations cover `0.2.0-rc.1`"},{"id":"p26s5","text":", `0.2.0-rc.2`, and `0.2.1-alpha.1`, all `compatible`."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["evidence","evidence"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
